                "html": "<h4 class=\"center\">Fearnley Sports Center – Lifeguard Application Form</h4><p><b>Personal details</b><br><b>Name:</b> Peter Smith<br><b>Home address:</b> 130 South Main Street, Lake [[1]]<br><b>Contact number:</b> [[2]] (cell phone)</p><p><b>Present occupation:</b></p><ul><li>has temporary job as a part-time [[3]]</li><li>is studying PE</li><li>wants to be a high school [[4]] coach</li></ul><p><b>Qualifications</b><br>Already holds: water safety certificate<br>Certificate expires in: [[5]]</p><p><b>Relevant work experience</b><br>Lifeguard at: the [[6]] in Fearnley<br>Additional relevant skills: [[7]]</p><p><b>Other information:</b> is happy to</p><ul><li>work on [[8]] mornings</li><li>start at [[9]] o’clock</li></ul><p><b>How did the applicant find out about this job?</b> on the [[10]]</p>"
