                "html": "<h4 class=\"center\">Arizona – travel advice</h4><p><i>Example</i><br>• the temperature will probably be about <b>40</b> degrees centigrade during the day</p><ul><li>pack a [[1]]</li><li>drive from Tucson along the [[2]] trails</li><li>go to the [[3]] (highly recommended)</li><li>there is the possibility of playing [[4]]</li></ul><p><b>Visit Susie’s parents</b></p><ul><li>Susie’s parents live in a town called Williams</li><li>Address: 6073 [[5]] Drive</li><li>Town history:<ul><li>named after a local hunter</li><li>destroyed by fire in [[6]] (rebuilt later)</li></ul></li><li>Susie’s parents will be at home after 2nd July</li><li>4th July – Independence Day: there will be [[7]] in the evening</li><li>Susie’s parents’ phone number: [[8]]</li></ul><p><b>Grand Canyon</b></p><ul><li>tour by [[9]] (1½ hrs; 7 trips a day)</li><li>canoe (all day; important to take [[10]])</li></ul>"
