                "instr": "Questions 27–30<br>Which reason is given for the inclusion in Charlie's portfolio of each of the following pieces?<br>Choose <b>FOUR</b> answers from the box and write the correct letter, <b>A–F</b>, next to Questions 27–30.",
                "type": "match",
