                "html": "<h4 class=\"center\">Problems with flat</h4><p>Elinor has been in the flat for 3 months.</p><ol start=\"1\"><li>Elinor shares the flat with her [[1]].</li><li>Elinor must contact the landlord's [[2]] about the repairs.</li><li>The repairs cannot be started until next week.</li><li>Elinor may have to pay £[[3]] towards some repairs.</li><li>The agent suggests that Elinor should contact a [[4]] for urgent repairs.</li><li>Elinor can be contacted on her [[5]] number.</li><li>Elinor will need to sign the [[6]] after the repairs are completed.</li></ol>"
