                "html": "<h4 class=\"center\">NOTES ON PRESENTATION AND FEEDBACK</h4><p><b>Timing</b><br>Likely period for presentation: 14th – 24th June<br>Time of day: [[21]]</p><p><b>Format</b><br>First part: 40-minute presentation to the [[22]]<br>Second part: 20-minute interview with Dr Brown</p><p><b>Requirements</b><br>Must bring to discussion:</p><ul><li>material used in presentation</li><li>[[23]]</li><li>[[24]]</li><li>book list</li></ul><p><b>Feedback (given during interview)</b><br>Students will receive:</p><ul><li>[[25]]</li><li>'thinking questions'</li></ul><p><b>Criteria</b><br>Good projects will show the student:</p><ul><li>has done [[26]]</li><li>has ability to [[27]]</li><li>has ability to present [[28]]</li></ul><p><b>Next stage</b><br>Stage Two:</p><ul><li>produce [[29]]</li><li>do data analysis</li></ul><p>Further information from website: www.[[30]].com</p>"
